// ─── TECHNOLOGY STACK ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// Source of truth: master project document.
// Only technologies actively in use. Roadmap items are excluded.
// REMOVED: KVM/QEMU, ZFS, Bash, PKI/CA, LDAP, Grafana, Prometheus,
//          pfSense, WireGuard, Docker, Pi-hole, Tailscale, Uptime Kuma

